{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20019","headline":"连州吟 二 · 孟郊","name":"连州吟 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽翼不自有，相追力难任。\n唯凭方寸灵，独夜万里寻。\n方寻魂飘颻，南梦山岖嶔。\n髣髴惊魍魉，悉窣闻枫林。\n正直被放者，鬼魅无所侵。\n贤人多安排，俗士多虚钦。\n孤怀吐明月，衆毁铄黄金。\n愿君保玄曜，壮志无自沉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}